---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="System Dynamics - Sthenos">
  <nav>
    <a href="/">Sthenos</a>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="/drill">Drill</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="section" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1465101162946-4377e57745c3?w=1920&q=80');">
    <div class="content">
      <p class="label">05_system_dynamics.html</p>
      <h1>System Dynamics</h1>
      <p>Temporal behavior, feedback loops, and stability characteristics. The system is not static. It exhibits temporal behaviors that require monitoring.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="dynamics-grid">
      <div class="dynamics-item">
        <div class="dyn-marker" style="background: #a855f7;"></div>
        <h3>Feedback Loops</h3>
        <p>Evaluation → pipeline recalibration creates positive loop. Model improvements enhance evaluation accuracy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dynamics-item">
        <div class="dyn-marker" style="background: #f59e0b;"></div>
        <h3>Stream/Batch Divergence</h3>
        <p>EMA-based normalization diverges from static features over time. Monitoring required for long-running sessions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dynamics-item">
        <div class="dyn-marker" style="background: #22c55e;"></div>
        <h3>Convergence Zones</h3>
        <p>Static features stabilize after ~50 entities. Latency bounded at P95 < 500ms for 100 entities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dynamics-item">
        <div class="dyn-marker" style="background: #ef4444;"></div>
        <h3>Instability Triggers</h3>
        <p>Novel scenarios break rule thresholds. Rule brittleness + metric illusion risk on synthetic data.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="latency-box">
      <h3>Latency Bounded</h3>
      <p>P95 < 500ms for 100 entities. Scales linearly with entity count. No quadratic complexity surprises.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 24px 5%;
    z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  nav a {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.17px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .content-section {
    background: var(--space-black);
    padding: 80px 5%;
  }

  .dynamics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .dynamics-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--ghost-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ghost-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .dyn-marker {
    width: 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 13px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .latency-box {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 32px;
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .latency-box h3 {
    color: #818cf8;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .dynamics-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>